

🧠 DFDL Predefined Variables (Short Notes)

Variable	Meaning	Purpose	Example

encoding	Character set identifier (CCSID)	Batata hai data text kis format mein hai (UTF-8, ASCII, EBCDIC)	UTF-8 → CCSID 1208
byteOrder	Byte arrangement of multi-byte numbers	Kaunsa byte pehle aayega — Big Endian (MSB first) ya Little Endian (LSB first)	0x12345678 → Little Endian → bytes: 78 56 34 12
binaryFloatRep	Floating-point representation type	Float values ko kaise represent karna hai	IEEE 754 (modern), IBM Hex Float (old mainframes)



---

⚙️ Kaise Set Hote Hain

Automatically set by IIB/ACE from:

Transport headers (e.g., MQMD, HTTP)

DFDL schema properties (dfdl:byteOrder, etc.)

Node configuration / ESQL parameters




---

💡 Real Use

Input side → Parser inhe use karta hai bitstream ko correctly interpret karne ke लिए.

Output side → Serializer inhe use karta hai correct binary/text generate karne के लिए.

ESQL (PARSE / ASBITSTREAM) → Tum manually CCSID / ENCODING pass kar sakte ho.



---

👉 Simple Line Summary:

> encoding, byteOrder, aur binaryFloatRep = bridge between transport layer & DFDL schema, automatically handle hota hai data interpretation ke liye.